, and LegitScript compliance for telehealth.","intro":"Welcome to AHG Pay — dedicated underwriting and merchant processing for medical practices, clinics, and telehealth providers. Please submit your medical licenses, pharmacy board registrations, LegitScript credentials, and corporate records below.","licensingNote":"LegitScript healthcare merchant certification, active state board of pharmacy licenses for each state served, practitioner licensing for owners, and clinical compliance policies. Contact for West Town Checking Accounts: Ross Sloan (rsloan@dartbank.com), Caitlin Berlin (cberlin@dartbank.com).","sections":[{"id":"corporate","title":"Corporate & Identity Documents","description":"Essential legal identification for business entity and owners.","documents":[{"type":101,"name":"Articles of Incorporation","description":"State-filed professional corporation (PC/PLLC) or LLC formation.","required":true,"tag":null},{"type":102,"name":"SS-4 / EIN Letter","description":"Official IRS tax ID confirmation.","required":true,"tag":null},{"type":103,"name":"Voided Check or Bank Letter","description":"Pre-printed check or signed bank officer letter for settlements.","required":true,"tag":null},{"type":104,"name":"Driver''s Licenses / Passports (up to 4)","description":"Color photo ID for all 25%+ equity owners and managing physicians.","required":true,"tag":null},{"type":105,"name":"Operating Agreement (LLC) / Bylaws (Corp)","description":"Professional entity bylaws or operating agreement.","required":false,"tag":null}]},{"id":"financial","title":"Financial & Processing History","description":"Required to establish volume tiers and underwriting limits.","documents":[{"type":201,"name":"Bank Statements (Last 3 Months)","description":"All pages of primary business operating account (personal if no business).","required":true,"tag":null},{"type":202,"name":"Processing Statements (Last 3 Months)","description":"Current/prior merchant processing history (or N/A).","required":